Package: targetsworktree
Title: Safe Targets Stores for Git Worktrees
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Thomas",
    family = "Gade Koefoed",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "thomas.koefoed@sund.ku.dk"
  )
Description: Configures snapshot-backed targets stores in existing Git
    worktrees, converts them to endpoint-scoped writable stores, reconciles
    cached values before guarded runs, and quarantines writable output during
    teardown.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.5.0)
Imports:
    crew,
    targets,
    tidyselect,
    withr
Suggests:
    processx
URL: https://github.com/koefoeden/targetsworktree
BugReports: https://github.com/koefoeden/targetsworktree/issues
SystemRequirements: git, flock
